<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What it tells us</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">SMA is shifting from replacement of mi=
ssing SMN protein toward multidimensional combination care. Isembyld does not=
 compete directly with Spinraza, Evrysdi or gene replacement; it addresses pe=
rsistent muscle weakness after motor-neuron rescue.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">The mean benefit is meaningful but not=
 transformative, and monthly intravenous administration adds substantial burd=
en. Commercial adoption is therefore likely to concentrate initially among pa=
tients who remain functionally impaired despite stable SMN-directed treatment=
. Payers may demand documented plateau or decline before authorizing an indef=
inite add-on biologic.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What to watch next</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Adult uptake, ambulatory evidence, dur=
ability beyond one year, fracture incidence and whether muscle-directed treat=
ment expands to other neuromuscular diseases.</p>
<h4 style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#1=
2395b;margin:16px 0 6px;">Oral prophylaxis and earlier obesity treatment expa=
nd chronic-therapy frontiers</h4>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Pharvaris=E2=80=99s 85-patient Phase 3=
 CHAPTER-3 trial showed an 83% reduction in hereditary-angioedema attacks ver=
sus placebo with once-daily deucrictibant XR; the reduction was 87% among typ=
e 1 and type 2 patients. No treatment-related serious adverse events were rep=
orted. The result is compelling but based on a small, 24-week trial, and abso=
lute attack rates have not been disclosed=E2=80=94making cross-trial comparis=
ons with injectable prophylactics premature. If confirmed, the immediate- and=
 extended-release formulations could give Pharvaris a differentiated oral fra=
nchise spanning rescue and prevention. (<a href=3D"https://ir.pharvaris.com/n=
ews-releases/news-release-details/pharvaris-announces-positive-topline-data-c=
hapter-3-pivotal" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">Pharvari=
s</a>) (<a href=3D"https://ir.pharvaris.com/news-releases/news-release-detail=
s/pharvaris-announces-positive-topline-data-chapter-3-pivotal" style=3D"color=
:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">ir.pharvaris.com</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Separately, Novo Nordisk reported that=
 40.4% of children aged 6=E2=80=9311 receiving semaglutide plus lifestyle int=
ervention were no longer classified as having obesity after 68 weeks, versus =
none on placebo. More than 85% had severe obesity at baseline, and no growth =
or pubertal-development signal was identified. The finding strengthens medica=
l treatment of severe pediatric obesity, but the withheld mean BMI result, tr=
eatment-estimand framing and need for long-term therapy limit interpretation =
until presentation at ObesityWeek in November. (<a href=3D"https://www.novono=
rdisk.com/news-and-media/news-and-ir-materials/news-details.html?id=3D916600"=
 style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">Novo Nordisk</a>) (<a hre=
f=3D"https://www.novonordisk.com/news-and-media/news-and-ir-materials/news-de=
tails.html?id=3D916600" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">no=
vonordisk.com</a>)</p>
<h3 style=3D"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:17px;col=
or:#12395b;margin:22px 0 8px;">Additional Company and Regulatory Signals</h3>
<ul style=3D"margin:0 0 12px;padding-left:22px;">
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;"><strong>Biohaven=E2=80=99s epilepsy li=
