>) (<a href=3D"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1935979/00019359792600=
0077/bhvn-20260904.htm?utm_source=3Dopenai" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decor=
ation:underline;">sec.gov</a>)</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;"><strong>HER2-mutant lung cancer gained=
 a second first-line targeted option.</strong> FDA expanded Bayer=E2=80=99s H=
yrnuo to untreated advanced disease after a single-arm study produced a 75% r=
esponse rate; 38% of responders remained in response for at least 12 months. =
The accelerated approval creates direct competition with already-approved zon=
gertinib, but comparative durability and toxicity=E2=80=94not response rate a=
lone=E2=80=94will determine sequencing. (<a href=3D"https://www.fda.gov/drugs=
/resources-information-approved-drugs/fda-grants-accelerated-approval-sevaber=
tinib-locally-advanced-or-metastatic-non-squamous-non-small" style=3D"color:#=
1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">FDA</a>) (<a href=3D"https://www.fda.gov/d=
rugs/resources-information-approved-drugs/fda-grants-accelerated-approval-sev=
abertinib-locally-advanced-or-metastatic-non-squamous-non-small" style=3D"col=
or:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">fda.gov</a>)</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;"><strong>FDA codified a lower-friction =
pathway for cardiovascular AI alerts.</strong> A final order effective Septem=
ber 11 classified machine-learning notification software as Class II, allowin=
g future substantially equivalent products to use the 510(k) pathway. Special=
 controls explicitly address clinical performance, model bias and generalizab=
ility, human factors and overreliance. The likely strategic effect is faster =
category expansion=E2=80=94and greater commoditization of stand-alone alerts=
=E2=80=94shifting differentiation toward proprietary data, workflow integrati=
on and demonstrated impact on downstream care. (<a href=3D"https://www.govinf=
o.gov/content/pkg/FR-2026-09-11/pdf/FR-2026-09-11.pdf" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a=
;text-decoration:underline;">Federal Register</a>) (<a href=3D"https://www.go=
vinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2026-09-11/pdf/FR-2026-09-11.pdf?utm_source=3Dopenai=
" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">govinfo.gov</a>)</li>
